        <p>Signs</p>
        <p>of Consumption :</p>
        <p>Night Sweats, Wasting Away, Blood Spitting. The man whose Cure is proved below had all these and other signs of Consumption.</p>
        <p>co:q--; 8 ‘lO</p>
