        <p>He wasted away to 9 stone 4. He weighs now II stone 7.</p>
        <p>MR. MARK CHAPMAN, Plum Tree Cottage, Breach Hill, Chew Stoke, Somerset, not far from Bristol, is sturdy and robust, but he was oaly saved from a Consumptive's grave by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills. "I caught a bad cold last spring," he stated; "continued working outdoors, and in a couple of days was laid up with Inflammation of the Lungs. The pains in my shoulders, back and side were very bad. I felt better after the doctor had attended me for a couple of weeks; went to work, but commenced</p>
        <p>W arnings of Consumption : Ancenzia, Breathlessness, Indigestion, Chilliness, Weakness, and Pale Lips. The man whose life was saved, as proved below, was on the verge of. Consumption.</p>
        <p>D6WILLI , - E 0</p>
        <p>Saved Him.</p>
        <p>If he had worked a little longer he would have died. "My illness began with indigestion and bronchitis," said Mr. Peters a middle-aged collier, living at 27 Bryn Coed-road, Moss, North Wales. "When I got over the acute stage I felt weak and shaky, with a continual feeling of cold and weakness. During three months I gradually grew worse, and finally had to give up work altogether and remain in bed. Owing to the Indigestion I could not eat very much, and got no nourishment from the little I did take. I had also Palpitation of the Heart, and grew so thin and weak that the doctor said</p>
        <p>I was in a Consumption. "By this time the doctor was attending me twice a day, and would allow no one but my wife to see me. I was wasting away, no treatment seeming. capable of stopping it. 'Yet," he continued, "I am as strong and hearty as ever now—DE Williams' Pink Pills for Pale People have made me so. Everyone in my part of the country has faith in Dr. Williams' Pink Pills, and with good. reason. In two or three weeks after commencing them there was already a great improvement. I found that my stomach and Lungs were becoming Stronger. I could take food and enjoy it. The wasting away stopped, and I gained in strength and flesh. After taking seven boxes I was able ,to go back to work as strong and hearty as ever. I often work in wet places now, but do not mind it, and an occasional Dr. Williams' Pink Pill keeps me in the best of health. They have also cured my wife of Palpitation of the Heart."</p>
