        <p>This frightened me, as the wounded lung did not heal, and the Blood-Spitting continued. I commenced to waste away and it was plain that</p>
        <p>I was in a Consumption, as I was short of breath, had palpitation of the heart, and night sweats. " 3y good fortune I read of an Essex man being cured of Consumption by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills for Pale People. I had heard them well spoken of too, and of course tried them. After taking one box I stopped Spitting Blood, and was able to go to work again. I continued the Pills; the wasting away ceased by degrees, and the other symptoms—breathlessness and night sweats—went away too. I began to grow stronger and stouter, and after taking the pills my weight increased from 9 stone 4 pounds to xi stone 7 pounds, several pounds heavier than I ever was before my illness."</p>
