        <p>RUIVAIRN RECREkTiON V. LATOHTITID RANGERS.</p>
        <p>This encounter took plaee on the Rem' enclosure on Satur- day in windy weather. The visitors won the toss and playeri down th- slope with the wind in their favour After the kick-off, they immediately pressed but they kicked too strongly later a passing movement saw Hankinson open the score for the visitors. Th 3 go si kick we,. unsuccessful The same olayer had bard Rues shortly afterwards, being knocked into touch ou tie line and sustaining injury to his shoul 'er Half-time arrived with the visitors leading by one try to nil On resumption the Rees. immediately pressed, and the visitors being penalize , Woods placed a neat goal. The same player made lass mistake with a second shot a few micutes later. Mgr...9151y a hard game resulted in a win for Runcorn Recs. by two goals (4 point.) to one try (3 points) RUNC 'A V. V. STOCKPORT "A "</p>
        <p>This fixture in the seml-fleal of the Cheshire Junior Con Coinpetition was played at Stockn)rt on Saturday afternoon. and after a good game resulted In a pointless draw. The replayed match on Wednesday resulted in another draw the score being a try each</p>
